same key, same IV   (run1 vs run2): IDENTICAL
same key, IV+1 bit  (run1 vs run3): different

run1  be34106b88d2cbca3841b72b9499dc6c420c8e68fc7f8899fd464d2e1dd28626
run2  be34106b88d2cbca3841b72b9499dc6c420c8e68fc7f8899fd464d2e1dd28626
